    "orcaios.welcome.push": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orca's push only reaches the official app.\nSend this prompt to an AI on your computer; it switches Orca to the community gateway and restarts Orca. Then open this app once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方推送只发给官方 App。\n把下面的提示词发给电脑上的 AI，它会把 Orca 改用社区推送网关并自动重启 Orca。完成后回到这个 App 打开一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方推播只發給官方 App。\n把下面的提示詞傳給電腦上的 AI，它會把 Orca 改用社群推播閘道並自動重新啟動 Orca。完成後回到這個 App 開啟一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "orcaios.welcome.pushHeading": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Push notifications"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推送通知"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推播通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "orcaios.welcome.pushPrompt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please set up push notifications from my Orca desktop to the community iPhone app (orca-ios, bundle id com.thm.orcaios):\n1. Orca desktop picks its push gateway from the environment variable ORCA_PUSH_GATEWAY_URL. Set it to %1$@.\n2. macOS: run `launchctl setenv ORCA_PUSH_GATEWAY_URL %1$@`, and add a LaunchAgent in ~/Library/LaunchAgents that runs the same command at login so it survives a restart. Windows: set a user environment variable with that name and value. Linux: add it to the environment Orca starts with (for example ~/.config/environment.d/orca.conf).\n3. Orca reads it only at launch, so restart Orca for me: on macOS run `nohup perl -MPOSIX -e 'setsid(); exec @ARGV' sh -c 'sleep 3; osascript -e \"quit app \\\"Orca\\\"\"; sleep 5; open -a Orca' >/dev/null 2>&1 &`. It runs detached from your own process, so it still works if you are running inside Orca; tell me before you run it that Orca will close and reopen. On Windows or Linux, quit Orca completely and start it again.\n4. Tell me when it's done. Note: after this, this computer no longer sends notifications to the official Orca app; removing the variable and restarting Orca undoes it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请帮我把这台电脑上 Orca 桌面端的手机推送改到社区推送网关，让社区版 iPhone App（orca-ios，包名 com.thm.orcaios）能收到通知：\n1. Orca 桌面端通过环境变量 ORCA_PUSH_GATEWAY_URL 选择推送网关，把它设为 %1$@。\n2. macOS：运行 `launchctl setenv ORCA_PUSH_GATEWAY_URL %1$@`，并在 ~/Library/LaunchAgents 里加一个登录时执行同一条命令的 LaunchAgent，保证重启后仍然生效。Windows：设置同名的用户环境变量。Linux：写进 Orca 启动时的环境（例如 ~/.config/environment.d/orca.conf）。\n3. Orca 只在启动时读取这个变量，请帮我重启 Orca：macOS 上运行 `nohup perl -MPOSIX -e 'setsid(); exec @ARGV' sh -c 'sleep 3; osascript -e \"quit app \\\"Orca\\\"\"; sleep 5; open -a Orca' >/dev/null 2>&1 &`。它和你自己的进程脱离，即使你运行在 Orca 里也能执行完；运行前先告诉我 Orca 会关掉再自动打开。Windows 或 Linux 上请完全退出 Orca 再重新打开。\n4. 完成后告诉我。注意：设置之后，这台电脑不再给官方 Orca App 发推送；删掉这个变量并重启 Orca 即可恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請幫我把這台電腦上 Orca 桌面端的手機推播改到社群推播閘道，讓社群版 iPhone App（orca-ios，套件識別碼 com.thm.orcaios）能收到通知：\n1. Orca 桌面端透過環境變數 ORCA_PUSH_GATEWAY_URL 選擇推播閘道，把它設為 %1$@。\n2. macOS：執行 `launchctl setenv ORCA_PUSH_GATEWAY_URL %1$@`，並在 ~/Library/LaunchAgents 加一個登入時執行同一條命令的 LaunchAgent，確保重新開機後仍然生效。Windows：設定同名的使用者環境變數。Linux：寫進 Orca 啟動時的環境（例如 ~/.config/environment.d/orca.conf）。\n3. Orca 只在啟動時讀取這個變數，請幫我重新啟動 Orca：macOS 上執行 `nohup perl -MPOSIX -e 'setsid(); exec @ARGV' sh -c 'sleep 3; osascript -e \"quit app \\\"Orca\\\"\"; sleep 5; open -a Orca' >/dev/null 2>&1 &`。它和你自己的程序脫離，即使你執行在 Orca 裡也能完成；執行前先告訴我 Orca 會關閉再自動開啟。Windows 或 Linux 上請完全結束 Orca 再重新開啟。\n4. 完成後告訴我。注意：設定之後，這台電腦不再給官方 Orca App 推播；刪掉這個變數並重新啟動 Orca 即可復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
